      "writtenOn": "2022-07-19T16:25:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Will this still be updating when the GPADCs are turned off?  \n\nWhen is it that we expect to have Vbus present while the GPADCs are off?  Just while waking from low power mode?",
      "revId": "b419957072bf37de138e6ed3045b4de495507f41",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
