      "writtenOn": "2022-07-19T23:38:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, the `CHG_DET` bit that `is_vbus_present` reads still updates when the GPADCs are turned off. This path for digital presence exists precisely because not doing it makes the port get stuck looking for VBUS when a charger is connected while the GPADCs are off.\n\nAnd yes, I expect this path to only be needed when a parter is connected while the charger is in LPM: we only disable the GPADCs when entering LPM, so this should only be relevant when we\u0027re evaluating whether we need to exit LPM.",
      "parentUuid": "0b025c45_061e98fd",
      "revId": "b419957072bf37de138e6ed3045b4de495507f41",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    }
